cs","1 GB, Shader Model 3.0"],["DirectX","Version 9.0c"],["Storage","100 MB available space"],["Additional Notes","Keyboard and Mouse Recommended"]],"rec":[],"deck":0,"blurb":"Across more than a hundred levels in four worlds, this first-person game asks you to shoot and jump your way through puzzles built from moving targets and incoming projectiles. Clearing a stage means timing shots, jumps and dodges precisely. Unlockable modifiers let you replay levels in Mirror and Fast versions, and collectible evidence points to a mystery behind the arcade.\n\nDying and retrying quickly is part of the rhythm, so it suits players who enjoy precision challenges and learning a stage by repetition. The look is bright and cheerful, the soundtrack is by Calum Bowen, and it is single-player with full controller support."}}